MODULE: ClassNonStarvationCapacityOpportunityNeverGrants
TARGET: ClassNonStarvation
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: runtime opportunities continue but admission never grants an eligible waiter
PERTURBS: CapacityOpportunity

--- FIND
       THEN \E r \in Members(queue) : Admit(r)
--- REPLACE
       THEN UNCHANGED <<holders, free, withheld, queue, status, role, observed, pressure,
        pressurePhase, drain, hung, holdLeft, deadline, frontier, banked, checkpoint,
        holes, ledger, opportunity, arrivalsClosed, clientActive, cancelled>>
--- END
